            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data are part of the research project: FRIEND (Fall pRevention ImplEmeNtation stuDy). The repository contains the raw dataset \"Dataset_reframing communication_FRIEND\" and the syntax \"Syntax_reframing communication_FRIEND\". Data includes survey data.\n\nThis study aimed to investigate whether positive framing in communication leads to higher intention to participate in an FPP among community-dwelling older adults. We conducted a two-sequence randomized crossover study investigating differences of intention to participate after receiving an a priory designed flyer (standard flyer vs. reframed flyer) containing differences in textual content. Data was generated within this study."
                },
